ージズボン』の姿でお願いいたします。\n表情や構図などはカヂロさんにお任せいたします。\n\nご検討の程、何卒よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://zuma-daihuku.fanbox.cc/posts/10479559", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kadikadisake/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6fe3cc00/uploads/origins/de960b2f-a4b2-4f2a-9361-511c6193ccae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74d9209e3d14f1afa3d28e4e131fb25b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6fe3cc00/uploads/origins/de960b2f-a4b2-4f2a-9361-511c6193ccae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74d9209e3d14f1afa3d28e4e131fb25b, https://si.imgix.net/6fe3cc00/uploads/origins/de960b2f-a4b2-4f2a-9361-511c6193ccae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6292d4e5d33703619813f5f040c94051 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6fe3cc00/uploads/origins/de960b2f-a4b2-4f2a-9361-511c6193ccae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4c8b203ea111c1545731995337d6238 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "犬系の彼氏のファンです！！活動応援しております！！\n\nうちの子を描いていただけないでしょうか\n構図や服装などは全てお任せとさせてください！\n\nOC資料など:\nhttps://kaguo.net/contents/character\nhttps://kaguo.net/artworks", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kadikadisake/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8be01642/uploads/origins/c53fa8d7-6c54-4503-8574-f840772946ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80080afd053cd108ff3396c177fc1aa7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8be01642/uploads/origins/c53fa8d7-6c54-4503-8574-f840772946ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80080afd053cd108ff3396c177fc1aa7, https://si.imgix.net/8be01642/uploads/origins/c53fa8d7-6c54-4503-8574-f840772946ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a4f6db6a6b3f37eb76a9777f4dc03e7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8be01642/uploads/origins/c53fa8d7-6c54-4503-8574-f840772946ab?bg=%23fff&auto=fo